A full-stack, voice-to-voice AI web application where users can consult an AI that adopts any professional persona (Doctor, Teacher, Chef, Lawyer). It features a 3D talking avatar, live speech-to-text, and the ability for the AI to dynamically write and render 3D animations and 2D charts based on the conversation.

> **Developer:** Ranee Singh (2nd Year B.Tech CSE - AIML)

## 🚀 Key Engineering Features
*   **3D Talking Avatar:** Integrated `TalkingHead.js` and `Three.js` to render a lifelike 3D model that animates in sync with the AI's speech.
*   **Dynamic Code Generation & Rendering:** The AI writes raw HTML/JS on the fly to render 2D charts (`Chart.js`) and 3D animations (`Three.js`) directly into the chat interface. 
*   **Sandboxed Execution:** Built a custom DOM-injection pipeline with a `try/catch` wrapper to safely execute AI-generated JavaScript without crashing the main application.
*   **Voice-to-Voice Pipeline:** Integrated browser `SpeechRecognition` for user input and `SpeechSynthesis` for AI output, complete with a regex pipeline to strip out Markdown and LaTeX artifacts before speaking.
*   **Context-Aware Memory:** Backend maintains a sliding-window chat history (last 10 messages) to provide conversational context without hitting token limits.
*   **MathJax Integration:** Automatically parses and renders complex LaTeX math equations provided by the AI into readable textbook formats.

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
*   **Frontend:** HTML5, CSS3, Vanilla JavaScript, Three.js, Chart.js, MathJax.
*   **Backend:** Node.js, Express.js.
*   **AI Engine:** Groq API (`openai/gpt-oss-120b` for ultra-fast inference).

